# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ALLOWLIST. This repo is PUBLIC. Everything is ignored unless named below.
#
# A new file at the root (a handoff doc, a research note, a PDF, a secret) stays
# local until someone deliberately adds a `!` line for it. Denylists leak: they
# only block what you thought of in advance.
#
# Private, local only, never in this repo:
#   paddle-server/ (payment bouncer, paid PDFs, packs, secrets), pdf-src/,
#   every *.md doc except README/SECURITY, .env, .claude/, .mcp.json,
#   spreadsheets, scratch and agent working files.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

/*

# repo plumbing
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitleaks.toml
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/.env.example

# build config
!/astro.config.mjs
!/tailwind.config.mjs
!/tsconfig.json
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json

# build, audit and deploy scripts (credentials come from env vars only)
!/prebuild.mjs
!/maintenance-audit.mjs
!/deploy.mjs
!/indexnow.mjs

# committed state: page dates, publish dates, deploy + IndexNow hash baselines
# (paths and hashes only; the CI deploy keeps the latter two current via cache)
!/sitemap-dates.json
!/page-published.json
!/.deploy-cache.json
!/.indexnow-state.json

# the website itself
!/src/
!/public/

# scripts/: only the ones that run without the private folders
!/scripts/
/scripts/*
!/scripts/kc-availability.mjs
!/scripts/test-ai-pricing.mjs
!/scripts/ci-*.mjs

# ── never, even inside allowed folders ──────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.p12
*.pfx
*credential*.json
*secret*
!/.github/workflows/secret-scan.yml
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.PREVIEW.html
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
